# Phase-4 replay archive — trade domain: a purchase the host cannot fill (the
# rifle costs 100, the opening credit is 50). The acting side already ran the
# game method locally, so the authoritative overwrite must carry the
# rejection marker (Purchase) — the guest applies the marker and rolls its
# provisional copy back; the rifle stays in stock and the reputation penalty
# is part of the converged state.
#
# Fossil of: TradeSimulationTests.Purchase_BeyondCredit_RejectedMarkerArrives
# Mechanism: TradeStockMachine.TryPurchase -> TraderStateMsg.RejectedAction

@0 trade g1 purchase item=rifle
@33 expect trade_received g1 1 within 1000
@33 expect trade_rejected g1 purchase
@33 expect trade_converged g1
